# No Canvas for text or tables

Do **not** create or use a Cursor Canvas (`.canvas.tsx`) for reviews, status reports,
dossiers, prose, or tabular data. Put that content in the **chat reply** as markdown.

Canvas only if the user explicitly asks for one, or the deliverable is inherently
visual (interactive charts / live diagrams) and chat text would be clearly worse.

SSOT for this preference also lives in the global Cursor rule
`~/.cursor/rules/no-canvas-for-text.mdc`.
